dLine\":\"\\\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh test_card.lean\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"30000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running command\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check\n<truncated 9106 bytes>\nONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T18:35:34Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Induction on Ball Cardinality**\\n\\nConsidering the provided theorem concerning ball cardinality, the plan is to verify the induction proof. The base case ($k=0$) needs examination, focusing on `(ballWithin G 0 v).card = 1`. Then, the inductive step assumes the theorem holds for k and aims to prove it for k+1, noting the key inductive hypothesis: either `ballWithin G k v = univ` or `(ballWithin G k v).card ≥ k + 1`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"echo \\\\\\\"Check task-168\\\\\\\"\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"1000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking command\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Wait for task-168\\\"\"}}]}\n15: {\"step_index\":170,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T18:35:37Z\",\"content\":\"Created At: 2026-09-11T20:35:37+02:00\\nCompleted At: 2026-09-11T20:35:37+02:00\\n\\nThe command exited with code 0.\\nOutput:\\nCheck task-168\\r\\n\\n\"}\n16: {\"step_index\":171,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T18:35:37Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"7841936c-55c7-41c5-92b8-9773cb8ee932/task-168\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking task status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check task-168 status\\\"\"}}]}\n17: {\"step_index\":172,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09